			"notes": "## Version [v1.5.0](https://github.com/lostmyself8/Mekanism-Extras/compare/80a52ab8087999272af4cc27d283f49019fe2f6a...1.20.1)\n\n### Added\n- Added the `Absolute`, `Cosmic`, `Infinite`, and `Supreme` factory lines.\n- Added JEI support, loot tables, block/item models, and compatibility recipes for the new factory content.\n- Added Mekanism add-on compatibility recipes for factory processing.\n- Added and updated translations for `en_us`, `zh_cn`, `ja_jp`, `ru_ru`, `fr_fr`, `es_ar`, `es_es`, and `es_mx`.\n\n### Fixed\n- Fixed Naquadah reactor GUI, render, multiblock, and packet sync issues.\n- Fixed the server-side item display issue for stacks above 100.\n- Fixed various texture and model issues around Naquadah-related content.\n\n### Changed\n- Ported and reorganized the mod codebase for `1.20.1`.\n- Reworked Naquadah-related blocks, items, textures, and recipes.\n- Reworked client GUI and render code for reactors, tanks, transporters, and energy cubes.\n- Removed obsolete `Tungsten`, `Refined Netherite`, and `Plasma` content from this branch."
		},
